[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":46,"col":10},"end":{"line":46,"col":21}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: this program's subscription at Push.beni:21:29 starts\nwith code of the module `Push`, and the compiler can write into a program's\nmount only a function written in place in the module that calls the program's\nconstructor. It lowers one module at a time, so it cannot write another module's\ncode there or name its private values (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §5, class\n4). What lifts it is writing another module's closure into the mount, the same\nmechanism a widget module's `update` needs."}]
